  "description": "Passive spread harvester for 15-minute binary rounds: a cheap chip (mid 0.20-0.42) with a deep, balanced, non-one-sided book and a calm underlying earns one resting maker bid 0.02 under its mid; when the mid climbs 0.03 over the bid the close is suggested and the thesis re-arms. Signal-only: the kernel adjudicates, sizes, gates every intent and owns the exit ladder.",
